17:["$","p","1",{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":"Personal care is where PCTs spend much of their time and where the role's real character shows. Two people can complete the same task in the same time, and one leaves the patient feeling cared for while the other leaves them feeling processed."}]
